# `agents.summaries`

List all agents with display metadata (label, harnesses, tags).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`AgentsSummariesResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.summaries --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "rust-lane",
      "name": "Rust Lane",
      "description": "Full Rust implementation lane — compiler, runtime, MCP server.",
      "skills_count": 2,
      "mcp_count": 1,
      "rules_count": 4,
      "letter": "R",
      "source": "project",
      "tags": [
        "implementation"
      ],
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "code-reviewer",
      "name": "Code Reviewer",
      "description": "Reviews diffs for security, correctness, and architecture drift.",
      "skills_count": 3,
      "mcp_count": 1,
      "rules_count": 2,
      "letter": "C",
      "source": "project",
      "tags": [
        "review",
        "workflow"
      ],
      "active": false
    }
  ]
}
```
